     {
      "text": "And ye are puffed up -- What contempt this pours upon the divisions among the Corinthians: \"Apollonians,\" and \"Paulinians,\" and \"Cephasites,\" all alike indifferent to this instance of gross sin!"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 5,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "destruction -- (Greek - ὄλεθρο, used elsewhere, 1 Thessalonians 5:3; 2 Thessalonians 1:9; 1 Timothy 6:9. never means annihilation.\n\nsaved -- (See Scofield \"Romans 1:16\").\n\nJesus -- Some ancient authorities omit \"Jesus.\""
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 10,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "world -- kosmos = mankind. (See Scofield \"Matthew 4:8\")."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
